  "actual_preimage": "The test-only fixture delta is committed at the exact candidate above. Prior source SHA 4d55db3a4a547f95e306990ed31c83b2c792f3bb3d168a707355f7be6b22eb31; new test restores the exact source-bound fact_text in finally, reads it back, and performs a fresh GET. The earlier unrun handoff is preserved unchanged.",
  "property": "On the current candidate, an actual local Legal encoder producer emits a selected two-member generation that is served by fresh HTTP GET/POST. Candidate-only vector retrieval and typed refusal controls remain distinct; test-fixture member mutation is restored before the sibling profileless refusal is evaluated.",
  "real_chain": [
    "Local `python -m polisyos.data_forge.domains.legal.batch embed-local` uses the exact offline cached encoder profile and emits generation d90936765b454ffd9ad0a3fa296b2341 with two candidate members and finite 2x1024 float32 fact vectors.",
    "The produced generation and membership are selected through the live local profile GET; fresh GET returns the same generation ID and inventory count 2.",
    "Fresh HTTP vector POST returns the source-bound candidate and the separate forged-quote fixture, both trust_tier=search_candidate; no authority is inferred from retrieval.",
